{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10457","headline":"崔司录宅燕大理李卿 · 高适","name":"崔司录宅燕大理李卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多雨殊未已，秋云更沈沈。\n洛阳故人初解印，山东小吏来相寻。\n上卿才大名不朽，早朝至尊暮求友。\n豁达常推海内贤，殷勤但酌尊中酒。\n饮醉欲言归剡溪，门前驷马光照衣。\n路傍观者徒唧唧，我公不以爲是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}